## SSLCertificatesApi

### Place a new SSL certificate order - creates invoice and queues issuance
## Place a new SSL certificate order - creates invoice and queues issuance
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/ssl/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "ssl": "<number>",
 "hostname": "<string>",
 "approver_email": "<string>",
 "frequency": "<number>",
 "coupon": "<string>",
 "csr_type": "<string>",
 "csr": "<string>",
 "firstname": "<string>",
 "lastname": "<string>",
 "email": "<string>",
 "address": "<string>",
 "city": "<string>",
 "state": "<string>",
 "zip": "<string>",
 "country": "<string>",
 "phone": "<string>",
 "company": "<string>",
 "department": "<string>",
 "agency": "<string>",
 "business_category": "<string>"
}


### Get available SSL certificate packages and pricing for placing a new order
## Get available SSL certificate packages and pricing for placing a new order
GET https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/ssl/order
