### Cancel an SSL certificate service - stops renewals at end of billing cycle
## Cancel an SSL certificate service - stops renewals at end of billing cycle
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/ssl/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

